{
  "id": "907",
  "title": "Year 2020",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-03-19",
  "synopsis": "What date is it? What comes first?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/907/f314eb7788d401fdea14c37c1f386fbf18d0f604.mp3?1584354091",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "今年是二零二零年\n\n张老师：今天是几月几号？\n本：今天是三月二十日，二十二十年。\n张老师：本，今年是二零二零年，不能说“二十二十年”。还有，在中文里，我们要先说年，再说月和日。\n本：好的。今天是二零二零年，三月二十日。\n张老师：很好！",
    "traditional": "今年是二零二零年\n\n張老師：今天是幾月幾號？\n本：今天是三月二十日，二十二十年。\n張老師：本，今年是二零二零年，不能說“二十二十年”。還有，在中文裡，我們要先說年，再說月和日。\n本：好的。今天是二零二零年，三月二十日。\n張老師：很好！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This is year 2020"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "张老师：今天是几月几号？",
      "traditional": "張老師：今天是幾月幾號？",
      "pinyin": "zhāng lǎo shī jīn tiān shì jǐ yuè jǐ hào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher Zhang: What is today’s date?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：今天是三月二十日，二十二十年。",
      "traditional": "本：今天是三月二十日，二十二十年。",
      "pinyin": "běn jīn tiān shì sān yuè èr shí rì èr shí èr shí nián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Today is March 20, year “20 20.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "张老师：本，今年是二零二零年，不能说“二十二十年”。",
      "traditional": "張老師：本，今年是二零二零年，不能說“二十二十年”。",
      "pinyin": "zhāng lǎo shī běn jīn nián shì èr líng èr líng nián bù néng shuō èr shí èr shí nián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "还有，在中文里，我们要先说年，再说月和日。",
      "traditional": "還有，在中文裡，我們要先說年，再說月和日。",
      "pinyin": "hái yǒu zài zhōng wén lǐ wǒ men yào xiān shuō nián zài shuō yuè hé rì",
      "english": "Teacher Zhang: Ben, this is year 2020, you can’t say “20 20.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Also, in Chinese we have to say the year first, and then say the month and the day."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "本：好的。今天是二零二零年，三月二十日。",
      "traditional": "本：好的。今天是二零二零年，三月二十日。",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de jīn tiān shì èr líng èr líng nián sān yuè èr shí rì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: OK. Today is year 2020, March 20."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "张老师：很好！",
      "traditional": "張老師：很好！",
      "pinyin": "zhāng lǎo shī hěn hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher Zhang: Very good!"
    }
  ],
